  "bodyHash": "Oj6GYjgL/G8=",
  "content": "<h2>通用茂密葉片</h2><p>一款即裝即用的茂密葉片資源包。<br>\n這並非市面上最頂尖的樹葉美化包，但它能完美達成任務，且能兼容任何模組包或您喜愛的資源包！<br>\n透過僅調整（幾乎）所有原版與模組樹葉的單一模型，您無需擔心兼容性問題，或材質看起來格格不入。</p><h3>模組兼容性</h3><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BqYw00D.gif\" alt=\"模組兼容性展示\"><br>\n大多數模組皆可開箱即用，但極少數情況下需額外調整，例如<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a>。<br>\n若發現不兼容的模組，歡迎加入我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>回報！</p><h3>資源包兼容性</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K2QW8EcS/images/f13c1dc468e177863fb5db4c14444c84a0cfd96e.gif\" alt=\"資源包兼容性展示\"></p><p>任何未修改樹葉模型的資源包皆可兼容，只需確保將其置於本資源包下方載入！<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K2QW8EcS/images/fc26f405cbc4746d9ca4151118ce7c1a792559d1.png\" alt=\"安裝順序示意圖\"></p><h3>效能表現</h3><p>在遊戲世界中為樹葉增加額外方塊會對效能產生一定影響。<br>\n我們已盡力將影響降至最低，並與同類資源包保持相當水準，但仍建議搭配使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcull-less-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Less Leaves</a>或類似模組，以便根據需求調整設定，維持流暢幀率！</p><h3>這是什麼樹葉？</h3><p>不清楚，但可能源自以下項目：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmellowed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mellowed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Miznuo's</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgrown Flowery GUI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f51e0kYxF\" rel=\"nofollow\">即將推出</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome's We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome's O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-bloomingnature\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blooming Nature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful 64x</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fclayful-128x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clayful</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwhimscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Whimscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmizunomcmemo.blogspot.com%252fp%252fmizunos-16-craft-cit.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizunos 16 Craft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ff8thful\" rel=\"nofollow\">f8thful</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fbsl-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complimentary Unbound</a></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持我們\"></a></p>",
